      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Over decades, Chandler Heights has slowly urbanized, with recent annexations of land along Chandler Heights Road into Chandler and Queen Creek fueling growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
