      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/chandler_heights_arizona",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Sandy loam soil, boosted by historic irrigation, once fed citrus farms, yet remains nutrient‑poor and alkaline like typical desert ground.",
